---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Pricing
permalink: /pricing/
eyebrow: Simple, clear pricing
heading: What it costs
lead: "No contracts and no expensive packaged foods. For weight loss, you pay per visit. For physicals, call either office for pricing."
description: "Glah Medical Group pricing: $65 initial weight loss consultation, $40 follow-up office visits, appetite suppressants $8–$16 per week if prescribed. Call for physical exam pricing."
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-4">Weight loss program</h2>
    <div class="row g-4">
      {%- for p in pricing.weightLoss %}
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <article class="price-card{% if p.featured %} price-card-featured{% endif %}" aria-labelledby="price-{{ loop.index }}">
          {%- if p.featured %}<p class="price-flag">Recommended</p>{% endif %}
          <h3 id="price-{{ loop.index }}">{{ p.name }}</h3>
          <p class="price">{{ p.price }}{% if p.unit %} <span>{{ p.unit }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
          <ul class="check-list mb-0">
            {%- for i in p.items %}<li>{{ i }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="ins-note ins-note-info mt-4">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <p class="mb-0"><strong>Why weekly?</strong> Weekly visits are recommended for the best results. Our goal is a healthy way of eating that lasts a lifetime, built on food from your own store, not products sold in our office.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" aria-labelledby="phys-price-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="phys-price-heading">Physical exams</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Prices depend on the form and any vaccines or lab tests you need. Call either office and we will give you the price before you book.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      {%- for p in physicals.list %}
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <a class="feature-card" href="{{ p.url }}">
          <span class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid {{ p.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <h3>{{ p.short }}</h3>
          <p class="price-call">{{ pricing.physicalsNote }}</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="ins-note mt-4" role="note">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <p class="mb-0"><strong>Insurance and payment:</strong> please call
        {%- for o in site.offices %} {{ o.name }} <a href="tel:{{ o.phoneHref }}">{{ o.phone }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} or{% endif %}{% endfor %} to ask about payment options before your first visit.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
